  "ingredients": [
    "8 chicken drumsticks, skin removed",
    "0.25 cup hot pepper sauce",
    "1 quart vegetable oil for frying",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons yellow cornmeal",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vyJQbKCpUF6MMxCSsufGWUJTSpg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-25492-firecracker-fried-chicken-drumsticks-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-4b9729fe74d445ec87e2af6c116735f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25492/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken into a resealable plastic bag and pour in hot sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZQ1sTGcREeSR6OJiJYbcbZM5HXo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-25492-firecracker-fried-chicken-drumsticks-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-8a61ce5633844c5895cdab83b755b73f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25492/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Massage the bag to coat chicken with sauce, squeeze out excess air, and seal the bag. Marinate in the refrigerator for at least 1 hour, or up to 24 hours for spicer chicken.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t4FLzR2fmI_JaDF3WikNO8rZmnM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-25492-firecracker-fried-chicken-drumsticks-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-b2c678b1cda6483f87a657d1fbb79f9e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25492/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep-fryer or large skillet to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Combine flour, cornmeal, and salt in another resealable plastic bag.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_x6hIylnPihWdReTZFgcTXgssUo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-25492-firecracker-fried-chicken-drumsticks-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-9771fd4facc34faab4ed23e1c5a68af2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25492/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the marinated drumsticks, seal the bag, and shake to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AgCbgCu_VD2ILOZGCEkEUUuHWao=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-25492-firecracker-fried-chicken-drumsticks-DDMFS-4x3-step-05-a03b28f868ae4467a1d26e3e41ab54d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25492/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry chicken, uncovered, in the preheated deep fryer, turning occasionally, until golden brown, crispy, and the juices run clear, 25 to 30 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
